id=cgroup_legacy
name=Source-compatible cgroup configuration for Exynos 990
version=2.2
versionCode=4
author=miguelbarretoo
description=Uses the S24+ compatible cgroup descriptors with the target's available legacy groups, preserves the source libcgrouprc/libchrome ABI, activates memory-v2 at boot, exposes cgroup.kill, and removes unrelated donor Chromium libraries.
